  "direction": "NARROWER_THAN canonical direct Host=narrow Target=broad; HAS_NARROWER is derived Host=broad Target=narrow and owns // so Broad//Narrow follows its owner. CONTAINS owns / whole→part; IS_CONTAINED_BY owns +> part→whole. INSTANCE_OF retains named syntax and no // alias.",
  "dependencies": [
    "R2817 alias Rule requires alias to follow owner Relation direction; alias move therefore requires R2620 as well as R2475.",
    "Typed descriptor addressing, contextual Subject migration and full CFEL source migration must be coordinated before admission.",
    "No named inverse Relation permission is implied by inverse declarations or syntax."
  ],
